      "date": "2026-02-14T21:36:21.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹16.43 (vs ₹18.82 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹16.43 (down from ₹18.82 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹2.79b (up 37% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹166.7m (down 13% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 6.0% (down from 9.3% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 10% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 5% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
